{"id":"naizust_","lemma":"наизусть","pos":"adv","rank":4917,"glosses":["by heart, by rote"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B8%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B8%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я знаю его наизусть.","en":"I know it by heart.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"him / his"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю все ваши песни наизусть.","en":"I know all your songs by heart.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},{"g":"canto","l":"песнь"},null]},{"text":"Я выучил это наизусть.","en":"I learned it by heart.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to learn","l":"выучить"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Сколько стихов ты знаешь наизусть?","en":"How many poems do you know by heart?","words":[{"g":"how much, how many"},{"g":"line of poetry","l":"стих"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null]},{"text":"Я мог бы рассказать эту историю наизусть.","en":"I could recite the story by heart.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to tell"},null,null,null]}]}